{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Small-twist limit of twisted Q: Laguerre roots at infinity (gl(2), L=2)\n\nBaxter: $T(u)q(u) = \\Delta_+(u)e^{i\\phi}q(u+i) + \\Delta_-(u)e^{-i\\phi}q(u-i)$, $\\Delta_\\pm=\\prod_a(u-\\theta_a\\pm i s_a)$, i.e. $Q=e^{\\phi u}$-type twist absorbed as $e^{\\pm i\\phi}$. Spins $s_1=s_2=1$, sector $M=2$: states = spin-2 descendant ($m=2$ roots at infinity), spin-1 descendant ($m=1$), spin-0 hw ($m=0$).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* generic numeric chain data; M=2 sector of 1⊗1 *)\nsp = {1, 1}; th = {0, 37/100}; M = 2;\nDp[u_] := Product[u - th[[a]] + I sp[[a]], {a, 2}];\nDm[u_] := Product[u - th[[a]] - I sp[[a]], {a, 2}];\nqq[u_] := u^M + Sum[c[k] u^k, {k, 0, M - 1}];\nsolveTwisted[phi_] := Module[{eq, T},\n  T = 2 Cos[phi] u^2 + t1 u + t0;\n  eq = CoefficientList[Expand[T qq[u] - Dp[u] Exp[I phi] qq[u + I] - Dm[u] Exp[-I phi] qq[u - I]], u];\n  NSolve[Thread[eq == 0], Join[{t1, t0}, Table[c[k], {k, 0, M - 1}]], WorkingPrecision -> 40]];\nrootsAt[phi_] := (u /. NSolve[qq[u] == 0 /. #, u, WorkingPrecision -> 40]) & /@ solveTwisted[phi];\nGrid[Prepend[{#, Sequence @@ (N[rootsAt[#], 6])} & /@ {10^-2, 10^-3, 10^-4}, {\"phi\", \"state 1\", \"state 2\", \"state 3\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<details class=\"vscode-wolfram-message-output\" style=\"color:#f44;border-left:3px solid #f44;background:rgba(255,68,68,0.08);padding:2px 6px;margin:1px 0;border-radius:0 3px 3px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:0.85em\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer\">4 warnings</summary><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">NSolve::precw: The precision of the argument function ({49906.51119857813782633329367561530727 + 499.6257440193664419378027958885512741 u + u }) is less than WorkingPrecision (40).</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">NSolve::precw: The precision of the argument function ({-57.53232924025594793896310631756248801 + 299.61977178248413416708077044776814692 u + u }) is less than WorkingPrecision (40).</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">NSolve::precw: The precision of the argument function ({-0.17033597113023500485867499598361594747 - 0.38218264629671368795252042922727539747 u + u }) is less than WorkingPrecision (40).</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">General::stop: Further output of NSolve::precw will be suppressed during this calculation.</div></details>",
